WEBVTT

00:15:58.916 --> 00:16:01.260
that is not relevant
because it's too small.

00:16:01.743 --> 00:16:03.885
Good taste is much bigger than this.

00:16:03.909 --> 00:16:07.930
Good taste is about really
seeing the big patterns

00:16:07.954 --> 00:16:12.412
and kind of instinctively knowing
what's the right way to do things.

00:16:12.436 --> 00:16:15.093
CA: OK, so we're putting
the pieces together here now.

00:16:15.736 --> 00:16:17.203
You have taste,

00:16:18.057 --> 00:16:20.394
in a way that's meaningful
to software people.

00:16:20.418 --> 00:16:21.569
You're --

00:16:21.593 --> 00:16:23.409
(Laughter)

00:16:23.433 --> 00:16:25.994
LT: I think it was meaningful
to some people here.

00:16:27.967 --> 00:16:30.884
CA: You're a very smart computer coder,